e entry and report `Thought already saved`.\\nWhitespace and case differences remain distinct. Thoughts accept 1 to 131072 bytes;\\nempty or oversized input refuses without changing the editor. Existing records are\\nnever edited or replaced. Read failures remain visible instead of becoming an empty list.\\n\"}\n]}));\ntext(await tools.edit({path:\"README.md\",edits:[\n{oldText:\"  Shape without changing saved sessions. In this repository, press `f`\",newText:\"  Shape without changing saved sessions. In this repository, `t` opens a raw thought editor.\\n  `F2` saves exact words without confirming a goal or calling a model. `v` reads thoughts;\\n  `g` opens one in Think, unsent. The thought stays on record after goal confirmation.\\n  In this repository, press `f`\"},\n{oldText:\"Think is practice: no model calls or saved goals. Tend writes needs only when you\\nexplicitly link or unlink.\",newText:\"Think is practice: no model calls or saved goals. Tend saves thoughts only on `F2`\\nand writes needs only when you explicitly link or unlink.\"}\n]}));\ntext(await tools.bash({command:\"export TMPDIR=\\\"$PWD/target/tmp/tinkery-TEST-build\\\"; python3 tests/test_documentation.py > target/thought-documentation.log 2>&1; result=$?; tail -15 target/thought-documentation.log; exit \\\"$result\\\"\",\"timeout\":120}));\n"},"partialResult":{"content":[],"details":{"calls":[{"id":"call_831536a1703347ff8ae1c0b682165aa5|ctc_0df587760909a640016af971b211b087d1af2fae91a9b07d72/1","name":"edit","args":"{\"path\":\"docs/design/architecture.md\",\"edits\":[{\"oldText\":\"| `shape/words.rs` | Shape's in-memory textarea adapter: editing, selection, cursor-following and original line-ending provenance; no save...","status":"ok","durationMs":1.7371669999556616},{"id":"call_831536a1703347ff8ae1c0b682165aa5|ctc_0df587760909a640016af971b211b087d1af2fae91a9b07d72/2","name":"edit","args":"{\"path\":\"docs/design/shape-and-handoff.md\",\"edits\":[{\"oldText\":\"Tend holds saved goals;\",\"newT