:\"| `tend/thought.rs` | Repository-bound raw thoughts, explicit private atomic saving and the local read/editor view; no sessions, model sources or goal authority. |\\n| `tend/connection.rs` |\"}\n]}));\ntext(await tools.edit({path:\"docs/design/shape-and-handoff.md\",edits:[\n{oldText:\"Tend holds saved goals;\",newText:\"Tend holds saved goals and raw repository thoughts;\"},\n{oldText:\"## Tend: garden and detail\\n\",newText:\"## Tend: garden and detail\\n\\nIn this repository's garden, `t` opens an exact-word thought editor. The screen names\\nthe repository before `F2` saves. Esc cancels without saving. Saving makes no model\\ncall and confirms no goal. Thoughts appear above the goal graph, labelled `Thought`.\\n`v` reads the saved thoughts; arrows select one and PgUp/PgDn scroll its words.\\n`g` copies the selected thought into a fresh, unsent Think visit. The existing\\nThink goal confirmation is still required. The thought stays unchanged on record.\\nThoughts cannot open Shape and never enter Find connections in this slice.\\n\\nThoughts use private atomic files under the captured Tend link root, separate from\\nsessions and goal confirmation records. Filenames bind the exact repository path\\nand exact UTF-8 words with SHA-256. Each record carries its repository explicitly.\\nIdentical bytes in one repository keep one entry and report `Thought already saved`.\\nWhitespace and case differences remain distinct. Thoughts accept 1 to 131072 bytes;\\nempty or oversized input refuses without changing the editor. Existing records are\\nnever edited or replaced. Read failures remain visible instead of becoming an empty list.\\n\"}\n]}));\ntext(await tools.edit({path:\"README.md\",edits:[\n{oldText:\"  Shape without changing saved sessions. In this repository, press `f`\",newText:\"  Shape without changing saved sessions. In this repository, `t` opens a raw thought editor.\\n  `F2` saves exact words without confirming a goal or calling a model. `v` reads thoughts;\\n  `g` opens one in Think, unsent. The thought stays on record after goal confirmation.\\n  In this repository, press `f`\"},\n{oldText:\"Think is practice: no model calls or saved goals. Tend writes needs only when you\\nexplicitly link or unlink.\",newText:\"Think is practice: no model calls or saved goals. Tend saves thoughts only on `F2`\\nand writes needs only when you explicitly link or unlink.\"}\n]}));\ntext(await tools.bash({command:\"export TMPDIR=\\\"$PWD/target/tmp/tinkery-TEST-build\\\"; python3 tests/test_documentation.py > target/thought-documentation.log 2>&1; result=$?; tail -15 target/thought-documentation.log; exit \\\"$result\\\"\",\"timeout\":120}));\n"}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-6.1-sol","usage":{"input":271,"output":757,"cacheRead":115712,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":22,"totalTokens":116740,"cost":{"input":0.000542,"output":0.00757,"cacheRead":0.0115712,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0196832,"totalFromProvider":false}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1794732461231,"responseId":"resp_0df587760909a640016af971ad696887d1887bf9bedb5e751f","rawStopReason":"completed","durationMs":16402,"thinkingLevel":"medium"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_831536a1703347ff8ae1c0b682165aa5|ctc_0df587760909a640016af971b211b087d1af2fae91a9b07d72","toolName":"codemode","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.4 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"text","text":"==> text 1/4 <==\nSuccessfully replaced 2 block(s) in docs/design/architecture.md.\n==> text 2/4 <==\nSuccessfully replaced 2 block(s) in docs/design/shape-and-handoff.md.\n==> text 3/4 <==\nSuccessfully replaced 2 block(s) in README.md.\n==> text 4/4 <==\n{\"output\":\"............\\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\\nRan 12 tests in 0.262s\\n\\nOK\\n\",\"truncated\":false,\"exit_code\":0,\"wall_time_seconds\":0.4}"}],"details":{"calls":[{"id":"call_831536a1703347ff8ae1c0b682165aa5|ctc_0df587760909a640016